Third-party data sources and services
-------------------------------------

This application reads public game data and community APIs. Void Ledger is not
affiliated with or endorsed by the providers below.

- Warframe world state and public export data (warframestat.us, content.warframe.com)
- Warframe Market API (warframe.market)
- Community Baro compendium data (Google Sheets, public read-only)
- AlecaFrame local cache (user-installed third-party tool; read-only import)
- Overwolf game events API (optional advanced inventory capture)

